  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Team Europe Initiative (TEI) Technical Assistance Facility (TAF) to the African Continental Free Trade Area (AfCFTA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim objective of the support by Denmark is to boost African continental economic integration. The specific objective is to operationalize the African Continental Free Trade Area (AfCFTA). Denmark will fund the support through the European Commission (EC). The project aims to support capacities from stakeholders across the continent to help implement the AfCFTA agreement. This includes the AfCFTA Secretariat, African Union Commission (AUC), the Regional Economic Communities (RECs), and countries as well as non-state actors such as the private sector and NGOs. All stakeholders that have an interest in enhancing intra-continental trade. Through a combined project of support, the project will be able to provide adaptable programming, advice and policy dialogue where the needs are identified.</narrative>
  </description>
